title mmWave Radar: hidden and shown again (X-Background=freeze): nothing drawn while hidden, a full repaint, close quits
sizes 480x320 640x480
lifecycle
env MMWAVE_DEMO three
env MMWAVE_TEST_CONFIG 1

wait 1500
hide
expect hidden
wait 800
expect nowrite
stale space
show
expect visible
wait 600
expect repaint
expect notext "PAUSED"
shot shown
close
expect quit
